{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L256","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:256"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Configures initial values, validation, listeners, and submission."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pass these options to a framework adapter's form creation API. Use\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"formOptions"},{"type":"text","value":" when declaring them separately so data and validator types\nremain inferred."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"const profileFormOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n  onSubmit: async ({ value }) => {\n    await saveProfile(value)\n  },\n})","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tformdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFormData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tformvalidators","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFormValidators"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormValidators"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/FormValidators.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormValidators"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tsubmitreturn","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TSubmitReturn"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TSubmitReturn"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tcomponents","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TComponents"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TComponents"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Library-managed. Do not specify explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Properties"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"formoptionscomponentssymbol","children":[{"type":"text","value":"[formOptionsComponentsSymbol]?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"readonly optional [formOptionsComponentsSymbol]?: TComponents;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L262","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:262"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"defaultvalues","children":[{"type":"text","value":"defaultValues"}]},{"type":"code","value":"defaultValues: TFormData;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L284","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:284"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Initial values and the source of the inferred data shape."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"They also define the reset baseline and what "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isDefaultValue"},{"type":"text","value":" compares\nagainst."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Async initial values:"}]},{"type":"text","value":" The passed value may change over time. While data\nis loading, pass fallback values containing the complete data shape, then\npass the resolved values when they become available."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When this option changes, untouched top-level values adopt the new defaults\nwhile values under touched top-level fields are preserved."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"errorvisibility","children":[{"type":"text","value":"errorVisibility?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional errorVisibility?: ErrorVisibility<TFormData, ToFormErrorTypes<TFormValidators, unknown>>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L299","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:299"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Controls when fields expose validation errors through public state."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This is the default policy for every field. A field can override it with a field-level\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"errorVisibility"},{"type":"text","value":" option."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When omitted, errors are always exposed."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"errorVisibility: ({ state, fieldState }) =>\n  fieldState.meta.isBlurred || state.submissionAttempts > 0,","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"formid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"formId?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional formId?: string;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L270","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:270"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A stable identifier for this form."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"When omitted, an identifier is generated and preserved across option\nupdates until a new "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"formId"},{"type":"text","value":" is supplied. Read the supplied or generated\nidentifier from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"formApi.formId"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"listeners","children":[{"type":"text","value":"listeners?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional listeners?: FormListeners<TFormData, ToFormErrorTypes<TFormValidators, unknown>>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L346","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:346"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Listener configurations for change, blur, submit, mount, and reset events."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Matching listeners are evaluated in array order. Their return values are\nignored, and returned promises are not awaited."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example-3","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"listeners: [\n  {\n    triggers: ['change'],\n    triggerDebounceMs: 200,\n    run: ({ value }) => {\n      saveDraft(value)\n    },\n  },\n],","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"onsubmit","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onSubmit?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional onSubmit?: FormSubmitFn<TFormData, TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L383","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:383"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called after submission validation succeeds."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Return an error created with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createValidationError"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"parseIssues"},{"type":"text","value":" to\nmark the submission as invalid. A returned promise is awaited before\nsubmission finishes. If the callback throws, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmitInvalid"},{"type":"text","value":" is called."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example-4","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  // ...\n  onSubmit: async ({ value }) => {\n    await saveUser(value)\n  },\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"onsubmitinvalid","children":[{"type":"text","value":"onSubmitInvalid?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional onSubmitInvalid?: (context) => void | Promise<void>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L403","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:403"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Called after an invalid submission is detected."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This includes validation failures, errors returned from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"onSubmit"},{"type":"text","value":", and\nexceptions thrown during validation or submission. A returned promise is\nawaited before submission finishes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"context","children":[{"type":"text","value":"context"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"FormSubmitInvalidContext.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"FormSubmitInvalidContext"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormData"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"link","href":"../type-aliases/ToFormErrorTypes.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ToFormErrorTypes"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFormValidators"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":">>"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":" | "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Promise"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"void"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example-5","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"{\n  // ...\n  onSubmitInvalid: () => {\n    document\n      .querySelector<HTMLElement>('[aria-invalid=\"true\"]')\n      ?.focus()\n  },\n}","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"serverstate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"serverState?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional serverState?: \n  | ServerFormState<NoInfer<TFormData>, NoInfer<TFormValidators>>\n  | null;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L362","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:362"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Server-validation state supplied by a server or SSR adapter during\nhydration."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pass a failed result's "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"serverState"},{"type":"text","value":" through unchanged. Constructing or\nmutating this state directly is discouraged."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example-6","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"serverState: failedResult.serverState,","lang":"ts"},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"validators","children":[{"type":"text","value":"validators?"}]},{"type":"code","value":"optional validators?: TFormValidators;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L326","children":[{"type":"text","value":"FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:326"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An ordered pipeline of form-level validators."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Validators run for their configured triggers and, by default, during\nsubmission. Keep the array length stable after initialization so\nvalidator-indexed errors and schema outputs remain aligned."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"example-7","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"validators: [\n  {\n    triggers: ['change'],\n    run: ({ value, createErrorMap }) => {\n      if (value.name) {\n        return null\n      }\n\n      return createErrorMap({ fields: { name: 'Name is required' } })\n    },\n  },\n],","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tformdata","text":"TFormData","level":3},{"id":"tformvalidators","text":"TFormValidators","level":3},{"id":"tsubmitreturn","text":"TSubmitReturn","level":3},{"id":"tcomponents","text":"TComponents","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"formoptionscomponentssymbol","text":"[formOptionsComponentsSymbol]?","level":3},{"id":"defaultvalues","text":"defaultValues","level":3},{"id":"errorvisibility","text":"errorVisibility?","level":3},{"id":"example-2","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"formid","text":"formId?","level":3},{"id":"listeners","text":"listeners?","level":3},{"id":"example-3","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"onsubmit","text":"onSubmit?","level":3},{"id":"example-4","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"onsubmitinvalid","text":"onSubmitInvalid?","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"context","text":"context","level":5},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"example-5","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"serverstate","text":"serverState?","level":3},{"id":"example-6","text":"Example","level":4},{"id":"validators","text":"validators?","level":3},{"id":"example-7","text":"Example","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:256](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L256)\n\nConfigures initial values, validation, listeners, and submission.\n\nPass these options to a framework adapter's form creation API. Use\n`formOptions` when declaring them separately so data and validator types\nremain inferred.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst profileFormOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n  onSubmit: async ({ value }) => {\n    await saveProfile(value)\n  },\n})\n```\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormValidators\n\n`TFormValidators` *extends* [`FormValidators`](../type-aliases/FormValidators.md)\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TSubmitReturn\n\n`TSubmitReturn`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TComponents\n\n`TComponents`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Properties\n\n### \\[formOptionsComponentsSymbol\\]?\n\n```ts\nreadonly optional [formOptionsComponentsSymbol]?: TComponents;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:262](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L262)\n\n***\n\n### defaultValues\n\n```ts\ndefaultValues: TFormData;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:284](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L284)\n\nInitial values and the source of the inferred data shape.\n\nThey also define the reset baseline and what `isDefaultValue` compares\nagainst.\n\n**Async initial values:** The passed value may change over time. While data\nis loading, pass fallback values containing the complete data shape, then\npass the resolved values when they become available.\n\nWhen this option changes, untouched top-level values adopt the new defaults\nwhile values under touched top-level fields are preserved.\n\n***\n\n### errorVisibility?\n\n```ts\noptional errorVisibility?: ErrorVisibility<TFormData, ToFormErrorTypes<TFormValidators, unknown>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:299](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L299)\n\nControls when fields expose validation errors through public state.\n\nThis is the default policy for every field. A field can override it with a field-level\n`errorVisibility` option.\n\nWhen omitted, errors are always exposed.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nerrorVisibility: ({ state, fieldState }) =>\n  fieldState.meta.isBlurred || state.submissionAttempts > 0,\n```\n\n***\n\n### formId?\n\n```ts\noptional formId?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:270](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L270)\n\nA stable identifier for this form.\n\nWhen omitted, an identifier is generated and preserved across option\nupdates until a new `formId` is supplied. Read the supplied or generated\nidentifier from `formApi.formId`.\n\n***\n\n### listeners?\n\n```ts\noptional listeners?: FormListeners<TFormData, ToFormErrorTypes<TFormValidators, unknown>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:346](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L346)\n\nListener configurations for change, blur, submit, mount, and reset events.\n\nMatching listeners are evaluated in array order. Their return values are\nignored, and returned promises are not awaited.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nlisteners: [\n  {\n    triggers: ['change'],\n    triggerDebounceMs: 200,\n    run: ({ value }) => {\n      saveDraft(value)\n    },\n  },\n],\n```\n\n***\n\n### onSubmit?\n\n```ts\noptional onSubmit?: FormSubmitFn<TFormData, TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:383](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L383)\n\nCalled after submission validation succeeds.\n\nReturn an error created with `createValidationError` or `parseIssues` to\nmark the submission as invalid. A returned promise is awaited before\nsubmission finishes. If the callback throws, `onSubmitInvalid` is called.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\n{\n  // ...\n  onSubmit: async ({ value }) => {\n    await saveUser(value)\n  },\n}\n```\n\n***\n\n### onSubmitInvalid?\n\n```ts\noptional onSubmitInvalid?: (context) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:403](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L403)\n\nCalled after an invalid submission is detected.\n\nThis includes validation failures, errors returned from `onSubmit`, and\nexceptions thrown during validation or submission. A returned promise is\nawaited before submission finishes.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### context\n\n[`FormSubmitInvalidContext`](FormSubmitInvalidContext.md)\\<`TFormData`, [`ToFormErrorTypes`](../type-aliases/ToFormErrorTypes.md)\\<`TFormValidators`, `unknown`\\>\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\n{\n  // ...\n  onSubmitInvalid: () => {\n    document\n      .querySelector<HTMLElement>('[aria-invalid=\"true\"]')\n      ?.focus()\n  },\n}\n```\n\n***\n\n### serverState?\n\n```ts\noptional serverState?: \n  | ServerFormState<NoInfer<TFormData>, NoInfer<TFormValidators>>\n  | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:362](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L362)\n\nServer-validation state supplied by a server or SSR adapter during\nhydration.\n\nPass a failed result's `serverState` through unchanged. Constructing or\nmutating this state directly is discouraged.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nserverState: failedResult.serverState,\n```\n\n***\n\n### validators?\n\n```ts\noptional validators?: TFormValidators;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:326](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L326)\n\nAn ordered pipeline of form-level validators.\n\nValidators run for their configured triggers and, by default, during\nsubmission. Keep the array length stable after initialization so\nvalidator-indexed errors and schema outputs remain aligned.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nvalidators: [\n  {\n    triggers: ['change'],\n    run: ({ value, createErrorMap }) => {\n      if (value.name) {\n        return null\n      }\n\n      return createErrorMap({ fields: { name: 'Name is required' } })\n    },\n  },\n],\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: FormOptions\ntitle: FormOptions\n---\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:256](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L256)\n\nConfigures initial values, validation, listeners, and submission.\n\nPass these options to a framework adapter's form creation API. Use\n`formOptions` when declaring them separately so data and validator types\nremain inferred.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nconst profileFormOptions = formOptions({\n  defaultValues: { name: '' },\n  onSubmit: async ({ value }) => {\n    await saveProfile(value)\n  },\n})\n```\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFormData\n\n`TFormData`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TFormValidators\n\n`TFormValidators` *extends* [`FormValidators`](../type-aliases/FormValidators.md)\\<`TFormData`\\>\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TSubmitReturn\n\n`TSubmitReturn`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n### TComponents\n\n`TComponents`\n\nLibrary-managed. Do not specify explicitly.\n\n## Properties\n\n### \\[formOptionsComponentsSymbol\\]?\n\n```ts\nreadonly optional [formOptionsComponentsSymbol]?: TComponents;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:262](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L262)\n\n***\n\n### defaultValues\n\n```ts\ndefaultValues: TFormData;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:284](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L284)\n\nInitial values and the source of the inferred data shape.\n\nThey also define the reset baseline and what `isDefaultValue` compares\nagainst.\n\n**Async initial values:** The passed value may change over time. While data\nis loading, pass fallback values containing the complete data shape, then\npass the resolved values when they become available.\n\nWhen this option changes, untouched top-level values adopt the new defaults\nwhile values under touched top-level fields are preserved.\n\n***\n\n### errorVisibility?\n\n```ts\noptional errorVisibility?: ErrorVisibility<TFormData, ToFormErrorTypes<TFormValidators, unknown>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:299](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L299)\n\nControls when fields expose validation errors through public state.\n\nThis is the default policy for every field. A field can override it with a field-level\n`errorVisibility` option.\n\nWhen omitted, errors are always exposed.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nerrorVisibility: ({ state, fieldState }) =>\n  fieldState.meta.isBlurred || state.submissionAttempts > 0,\n```\n\n***\n\n### formId?\n\n```ts\noptional formId?: string;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:270](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L270)\n\nA stable identifier for this form.\n\nWhen omitted, an identifier is generated and preserved across option\nupdates until a new `formId` is supplied. Read the supplied or generated\nidentifier from `formApi.formId`.\n\n***\n\n### listeners?\n\n```ts\noptional listeners?: FormListeners<TFormData, ToFormErrorTypes<TFormValidators, unknown>>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:346](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L346)\n\nListener configurations for change, blur, submit, mount, and reset events.\n\nMatching listeners are evaluated in array order. Their return values are\nignored, and returned promises are not awaited.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nlisteners: [\n  {\n    triggers: ['change'],\n    triggerDebounceMs: 200,\n    run: ({ value }) => {\n      saveDraft(value)\n    },\n  },\n],\n```\n\n***\n\n### onSubmit?\n\n```ts\noptional onSubmit?: FormSubmitFn<TFormData, TFormValidators, TSubmitReturn>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:383](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L383)\n\nCalled after submission validation succeeds.\n\nReturn an error created with `createValidationError` or `parseIssues` to\nmark the submission as invalid. A returned promise is awaited before\nsubmission finishes. If the callback throws, `onSubmitInvalid` is called.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\n{\n  // ...\n  onSubmit: async ({ value }) => {\n    await saveUser(value)\n  },\n}\n```\n\n***\n\n### onSubmitInvalid?\n\n```ts\noptional onSubmitInvalid?: (context) => void | Promise<void>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:403](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L403)\n\nCalled after an invalid submission is detected.\n\nThis includes validation failures, errors returned from `onSubmit`, and\nexceptions thrown during validation or submission. A returned promise is\nawaited before submission finishes.\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### context\n\n[`FormSubmitInvalidContext`](FormSubmitInvalidContext.md)\\<`TFormData`, [`ToFormErrorTypes`](../type-aliases/ToFormErrorTypes.md)\\<`TFormValidators`, `unknown`\\>\\>\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void` \\| `Promise`\\<`void`\\>\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\n{\n  // ...\n  onSubmitInvalid: () => {\n    document\n      .querySelector<HTMLElement>('[aria-invalid=\"true\"]')\n      ?.focus()\n  },\n}\n```\n\n***\n\n### serverState?\n\n```ts\noptional serverState?: \n  | ServerFormState<NoInfer<TFormData>, NoInfer<TFormValidators>>\n  | null;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:362](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L362)\n\nServer-validation state supplied by a server or SSR adapter during\nhydration.\n\nPass a failed result's `serverState` through unchanged. Constructing or\nmutating this state directly is discouraged.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nserverState: failedResult.serverState,\n```\n\n***\n\n### validators?\n\n```ts\noptional validators?: TFormValidators;\n```\n\nDefined in: [FormApi/FormApi.public.ts:326](https://github.com/TanStack/form/blob/main/packages/form-core/src/FormApi/FormApi.public.ts#L326)\n\nAn ordered pipeline of form-level validators.\n\nValidators run for their configured triggers and, by default, during\nsubmission. Keep the array length stable after initialization so\nvalidator-indexed errors and schema outputs remain aligned.\n\n#### Example\n\n```ts\nvalidators: [\n  {\n    triggers: ['change'],\n    run: ({ value, createErrorMap }) => {\n      if (value.name) {\n        return null\n      }\n\n      return createErrorMap({ fields: { name: 'Name is required' } })\n    },\n  },\n],\n```\n"}
